namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamWidgetViewModelSlot {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetViewModelSlot.h#DreamWidgetViewModelSlot
    src   "One `viewmodels` entry, compiled: the class variable that holds the object, the class it must be, and where the\nobject comes from. Filled at Initialize, after the tree is instanced and before NativeOnInitialized\n(UDreamUserWidget::ResolveViewModels), so On Initialized and every binding's first value already see it.\n\nThe variable itself is an ordinary Blueprint variable the compiler declares -- an object reference of Class,\nFieldNotify and Expose on Spawn -- so a host setting it is heard by every binding that reads through it."
    text  "一个已编译的`viewmodels`条目：保存对象的类变量、它必须是哪个类，以及对象来自\n哪里。在Initialize时填充，此时树已实例化、早于NativeOnInitialized\n（UDreamUserWidget::ResolveViewModels），因此On Initialized和每个绑定的首个值已经能看到它。\n\n该变量本身是编译器声明的一个普通蓝图变量——Class的对象引用，\n带FieldNotify和Expose on Spawn——因此宿主控件设置它时，每个通过它读取的绑定都能收到。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetViewModelSlot:Class {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetViewModelSlot.h#DreamWidgetViewModelSlot:Class
    src   "The declared class. Any UObject class; one implementing INotifyFieldValueChanged is what makes bindings through it subscribe instead of poll."
    text  "声明的类。任意UObject类；实现了INotifyFieldValueChanged的类会让通过它的绑定改为订阅而非轮询。"
    state machine
}

DreamWidgetViewModelSlot:SourceName {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetViewModelSlot.h#DreamWidgetViewModelSlot:SourceName
    src   "Global and Parent: the name written after the keyword (`global \"Stash\"`). None when the class alone decides."
    text  "Global和Parent：写在关键字后面的名称（`global \"Stash\"`）。仅由类决定时为空。"
    state machine
}

