EDreamViewModelSource {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetViewModelSlot.h#EDreamViewModelSource
    src   "Where a `viewmodels { … }` entry's object comes from when nobody handed one over.\n\nHost is what an entry with nothing after its name means: whoever makes the widget supplies the object -- an Expose\non Spawn pin of Create Dream Widget, UDreamUserWidget::SetViewModel, a Blueprint Set, or a host's own\n`Name <- Other.Thing` line on this widget used as a component."
    text  "当没有人提供对象时，`viewmodels { … }`条目的对象来自哪里。\n\nHost表示条目名称后不写任何内容时的含义：由创建控件的一方提供对象——Create Dream Widget的Expose\non Spawn引脚、UDreamUserWidget::SetViewModel、蓝图Set，或宿主在此控件用作组件时自己\n写的`Name <- Other.Thing`行。"
    state machine
}

EDreamViewModelSource.Global {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamWidgetViewModelSlot.h#EDreamViewModelSource:Global
    src   "`InventoryVM Inventory = global`, `= global \"Stash\"` -- UDreamViewModelSubsystem's, by class and name."
    text  "`InventoryVM Inventory = global`、`= global \"Stash\"`——来自UDreamViewModelSubsystem，按类和名称查找。"
